# RESET: SHAPE's SEL (twice) puts the page shown back as made (DRONE with its voices' own; VOX's pages the
# sound playing); SYSTEM > RESET SOUND (SEL twice) all of it: every page, the four VOX sounds, the FX page,
# HOME's macros, a throw kept. The scenes, the tempo and the loop stay. Once alone does nothing.
autoplay 0
wait 300
tap ENV
turn K1 10
expect shape11 95
key b2 down
turn K2 -5
key b2 up
expect dvoice32 65
tap SEL
wait 100
expect shape11 95
shot reset_ask.png
tap SEL
wait 100
expect shape11 75
expect dvoice32 75
turn SELECT 1
turn K1 8
expect vs1.1 80
tap SEL
wait 4000
tap SEL
wait 100
expect vs1.1 80
tap SEL
wait 100
expect vs1.1 64
tap ENV
turn K2 6
expect vs1.7 12
tap FX
turn K1 -4
expect fx0 83
tap HOME
turn K3 -5
expect macro3 54
press FX
turn K3 10
tap SAVE
release FX
wait 100
expect perf2 40
turn ALGO 5
expect set_bpm 95
tap GLO
turn SELECT 10
tap SEL
wait 100
expect vs1.7 12
tap SEL
wait 100
expect vs1.7 0
expect fx0 91
expect macro3 64
expect perf2 0
expect set_bpm 95
expect nscenes 4
expect clips 0
